  "prefLabel": "Rev 1903.05 Cost of the Bonds",
  "priorExpiration": "1998-03-16",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 1903.05 Cost of the Bonds.\n\n(a) The cost of the bond shall be paid by the respective municipality, pursuant to RSA 41:6, III, and RSA 149-M:17, III.\n\n(b) To operate within the bounds of RSA 31:95 and RSA 32:5, the cost of the bonds shall be appropriated annually whether the undertaking is issued for a one-year period or a multiple-year period of coverage.\n\nSource. #5356, eff 3-16-92, EXPIRED: 3-16-98\n\nNew. #6732, eff 4-18-98; ss by #8599, eff 4-6-06; ss by #10582, eff 5-2-14; ss by #13918, eff 3-29-24 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Rev 1900)",
